TapiocaOptionBroker_lock.tree
├── when the contract is paused
│   └── it should revert
├── when amount is 0
│   └── it should revert with SharesNotValid
├── when emergency sweep is active
│   └── it should revert with EmergencySweepActivated
├── when market is not active
│   └── it should revert with MarketNotActive
├── when user has existing position
│   ├── given position is not expired
│   │   └── it should update net deposits for previous expiry epoch
│   └── given position is expired
│       └── it should reset tapAmountExercised
└── when all conditions are valid
    ├── it should create/update participation position correctly
    ├── it should update market shares
    ├── it should update net deposits for current and expiry epochs
    ├── it should update total locked USDO
    └── it should transfer USDO from sender to contract
